--- Glossary
# Glossary

The following glossary describes terms used in the [Widget](https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Welcome.htm) guides.

- **agent**: A program that reports on its host. See [agents](https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Agents.htm).

- **asset_tag**: A label for grouping hosts.

- **baseline**: A saved state to compare against.

  Widgets keep one baseline per host.

